<h2 id="desirables-section-sites" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="02BA">113.3</span> Sites and Topoi</h2>

<p>
We have a chapter on sites and sheaves, see Sites, Section <a href="/tag/00V0" data-tag="00V0">7.1</a>. We have a chapter on ringed sites (and topoi) and modules on them, see Modules on Sites, Section <a href="/tag/03A5" data-tag="03A5">18.1</a>. We have a chapter on cohomology in this setting, see Cohomology on Sites, Section <a href="/tag/01FR" data-tag="01FR">21.1</a>. But a lot more could be added, especially in the chapter on cohomology. 
</p>
